					"content": "嗯…和我想的一样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "早柚"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170702,
					"content": "好多好多人…被盯上的话…会被发现…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "早柚"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170703,
					"content": "必须将他们引开，才能顺利潜入…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "早柚"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170704,
					"content": "只能相信宵宫了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20170705,
					"content": "等我拿到公文，我们再在<color=#00E1FFFF>木漏茶室</color>会合，可以吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "早柚"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170706,
					"content": "还有，如果我被抓了的话…请来救我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "早柚"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170707,
					"content": "真的没问题吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20170708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 20170708,
					"content": "总、总之我们还是先去<color=#00E1FFFF>千手百眼神像</color>那边吧！要小心不要被巡逻的人发现哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
